example local_context packet
{"inputs":{"source":"longer x:i > i\nx\n\nlong x:i > i\n+ x 3\n\nmain > i\nlong 4\n","name":"long","task":"double the input"},"expect":"double the input\nlong x:i > i\n+ x 3\nReturn only the new TIDE body as one prefix expression on one line."}

example preserve_layout replace_body
